@startuml
!include style.puml

title Global appointment-conflict check

start

:Receive candidate appointment;

:Check whether this is a new appointment;
if () then (yes)
    :No appointment is excluded;
else (else)
    :Remember original client and appointment
    as the exclusion;
endif

:Read the complete PawPals client list;

note right
The full client list is used.
The current UI filter is ignored.
end note

:Check whether more clients remain;
while (More clients?) is (yes)
    :Read the next client's active appointments;

    :Check whether more active appointments remain;
    while (More active appointments?) is (yes)
        :Check whether this is the excluded original appointment;
        if (Is this the excluded original appointment?) then (yes)
            :Skip this appointment;
        else (else)
            :Check whether the candidate overlaps this appointment;
            if (Candidate overlaps this appointment?) then (yes)
                :Return Conflict(owner, appointment);
                stop
            else (else)
                :Continue scanning;
            endif
        endif
    endwhile (no more appointments)
endwhile (else)

:Return Optional.empty();

note right
Completed-session history is never scanned.
Only active appointments reserve booking time.
Adjacent bookings are allowed according to
Appointment#overlaps(...).
end note

stop
@enduml
